HHIISSTTOORRYY
     Architecture-specific enhanced _l_i_b_c functions were added starting with
     FreeBSD 2.0 for ii338866, FreeBSD 6.0 for aarrmm, FreeBSD 6.1 for aammdd6644,
     FreeBSD 11.0 for aaaarrcchh6644, and FreeBSD 12.0 for ppoowweerrppcc6644.  SIMD-enhanced
     functions were first added with FreeBSD 13.0 for ppoowweerrppcc6644 and with
     FreeBSD 14.1 for aammdd6644.

     A ssiimmdd manual page appeared in FreeBSD 14.1.

