CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     Other parts of FreeBSD such as cryptographic routines in the kernel or in
     OpenSSL may also use SIMD enhancements.  These enhancements are not sub‐
     ject to the ARCHLEVEL variable and may have their own configuration mech‐
     anism.

BBUUGGSS
     Use of SIMD enhancements cannot be configured on powerpc64.

